body:
A cloud flow in the format of an exported solution (clientdata). A new item in the SharePoint list 'Leave Requests' starts a first approval for the manager with a two-day timeout. If the action times out, a second approval goes to a deputy from an environment variable. A Compose action merges both results with coalesce, and a Switch updates the list item and informs the employee. Replace site, list, column names and the deputy address.

=== Flow definition (JSON) ===
{
  "properties": {
    "connectionReferences": {
      "shared_approvals": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedapprovals_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_approvals"
        }
      },
      "shared_office365": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedoffice365_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_office365"
        }
      },
      "shared_sharepointonline": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedsharepointonline_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_sharepointonline"
        }
      }
    },
    "definition": {
      "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
      "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
      "parameters": {
        "$connections": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "Object"
        },
        "$authentication": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "SecureObject"
        },
        "DeputyApprover (contoso_DeputyApprover)": {
          "defaultValue": "deputy@contoso.example",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_DeputyApprover"
          }
        }
      },
      "triggers": {
        "When_a_leave_request_is_created": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "recurrence": {
            "frequency": "Minute",
            "interval": 5
          },
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
              "operationId": "GetOnNewItems",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
              "table": "Leave Requests"
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "splitOn": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/value']"
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "Ask_manager": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_approvals",
              "operationId": "StartAndWaitForAnApproval",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_approvals"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "approvalType": "Basic",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/title": "@concat('Leave request: ', triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/DisplayName'])",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/assignedTo": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Manager/Email']",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/details": "@concat('**Employee:** ', triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/DisplayName'], '\\n\\n**Type:** ', triggerOutputs()?['body/LeaveType/Value'], '\\n\\n**From:** ', formatDateTime(triggerOutputs()?['body/StartDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy'), '\\n\\n**To:** ', formatDateTime(triggerOutputs()?['body/EndDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy'), '\\n\\n**Note:** ', coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['body/Note'], 'none'))",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/enableNotifications": true,
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/enableReassignment": true,
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/itemLink": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/{Link}']",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/itemLinkDescription": "Open request"
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "runAfter": {},
          "limit": {
            "timeout": "P2D"
          }
        },
        "Ask_deputy": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_approvals",
              "operationId": "StartAndWaitForAnApproval",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_approvals"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "approvalType": "Basic",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/title": "@concat('Leave request: ', triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/DisplayName'])",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/assignedTo": "@parameters('DeputyApprover (contoso_DeputyApprover)')",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/details": "@concat('**Employee:** ', triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/DisplayName'], '\\n\\n**Type:** ', triggerOutputs()?['body/LeaveType/Value'], '\\n\\n**From:** ', formatDateTime(triggerOutputs()?['body/StartDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy'), '\\n\\n**To:** ', formatDateTime(triggerOutputs()?['body/EndDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy'), '\\n\\n**Note:** ', coalesce(triggerOutputs()?['body/Note'], 'none'))",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/enableNotifications": true,
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/enableReassignment": true,
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/itemLink": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/{Link}']",
              "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/itemLinkDescription": "Open request"
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "runAfter": {
            "Ask_manager": [
              "TimedOut"
            ]
          },
          "limit": {
            "timeout": "P2D"
          }
        },
        "Outcome": {
          "type": "Compose",
          "inputs": "@coalesce(body('Ask_deputy')?['outcome'], body('Ask_manager')?['outcome'], 'Expired')",
          "runAfter": {
            "Ask_manager": [
              "Succeeded",
              "TimedOut",
              "Failed"
            ],
            "Ask_deputy": [
              "Succeeded",
              "Skipped",
              "TimedOut",
              "Failed"
            ]
          }
        },
        "Check_outcome": {
          "type": "Switch",
          "expression": "@outputs('Outcome')",
          "runAfter": {
            "Outcome": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "cases": {
            "Approved": {
              "case": "Approve",
              "actions": {
                "Mark_approved": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                      "operationId": "PatchItem",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
                      "table": "Leave Requests",
                      "id": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/ID']",
                      "item/Status/Value": "Approved",
                      "item/DecisionBy": "@coalesce(body('Ask_deputy')?['responses']?[0]?['responder']?['displayName'], body('Ask_manager')?['responses']?[0]?['responder']?['displayName'], 'nobody')"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {}
                },
                "Mail_approved": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                      "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "emailMessage/To": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/Email']",
                      "emailMessage/Subject": "Leave approved",
                      "emailMessage/Body": "<p>Your leave request was approved.</p>",
                      "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Mark_approved": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "Rejected": {
              "case": "Reject",
              "actions": {
                "Mark_rejected": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                      "operationId": "PatchItem",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
                      "table": "Leave Requests",
                      "id": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/ID']",
                      "item/Status/Value": "Rejected",
                      "item/DecisionBy": "@coalesce(body('Ask_deputy')?['responses']?[0]?['responder']?['displayName'], body('Ask_manager')?['responses']?[0]?['responder']?['displayName'], 'nobody')"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {}
                },
                "Mail_rejected": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                      "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "emailMessage/To": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/Email']",
                      "emailMessage/Subject": "Leave rejected",
                      "emailMessage/Body": "<p>Your leave request was rejected. Please talk to your manager.</p>",
                      "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Mark_rejected": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "actions": {
              "Mark_expired": {
                "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                "inputs": {
                  "host": {
                    "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                    "operationId": "PatchItem",
                    "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                  },
                  "parameters": {
                    "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
                    "table": "Leave Requests",
                    "id": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/ID']",
                    "item/Status/Value": "Expired",
                    "item/DecisionBy": "@coalesce(body('Ask_deputy')?['responses']?[0]?['responder']?['displayName'], body('Ask_manager')?['responses']?[0]?['responder']?['displayName'], 'nobody')"
                  },
                  "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                },
                "runAfter": {}
              },
              "Mail_expired": {
                "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                "inputs": {
                  "host": {
                    "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                    "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                    "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                  },
                  "parameters": {
                    "emailMessage/To": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Author/Email']",
                    "emailMessage/Subject": "Leave request expired",
                    "emailMessage/Body": "<p>Nobody answered within four days. Please resubmit or contact HR.</p>",
                    "emailMessage/Importance": "High"
                  },
                  "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                },
                "runAfter": {
                  "Mark_expired": [
                    "Succeeded"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0.0"
}

=== How to use ===
1. Create the list 'Leave Requests' with the columns LeaveType (choice), StartDate, EndDate, Note, Status (choice: Pending, Approved, Rejected, Expired), DecisionBy and a person column Manager.
2. Create a solution, add an environment variable DeputyApprover and create the flow with the same actions. The JSON shows the structure; the designer creates connection references for you.
3. Test with timeout PT2M instead of P2D first, to see the escalation path quickly.
4. Turn on 'Flow bot' notifications in the Approvals app so that approvers get the request in Teams.

=== Common mistakes ===
- Reading outcome from the wrong action. If the manager answered, Ask_deputy is skipped and its body is null; coalesce handles this, a direct reference does not.
- Forgetting runAfter for TimedOut on the escalation. By default a timeout makes the next action skip.
- Using a timeout longer than the 30-day run limit. Approvals with long timeouts need a separate reminder flow.
- Assuming the first approval is cancelled on timeout. The original request stays visible to the manager; cancel or ignore it explicitly if needed.
- Using a person column without expanding it. The email is only available when the column returns the claims with Email.

=== Testing ===
- Submit a request and approve it as the manager. Check Status and the email.
- Submit a second request with a short timeout and do not answer; verify the deputy receives the second approval.
- Let both time out and verify that the status is Expired and the email has high importance.

When HR adds a person to the SharePoint list 'New Hires', this flow expands a task template into the list 'Onboarding Tasks'. Every task gets an owner and a due date relative to the start date. The manager receives a summary, and the flow waits until the day before the start and posts a Teams chat message if tasks are still open. The template is an array variable, so adding a task means adding one object.

=== Flow definition (JSON) ===
{
  "properties": {
    "connectionReferences": {
      "shared_office365": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedoffice365_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_office365"
        }
      },
      "shared_sharepointonline": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedsharepointonline_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_sharepointonline"
        }
      },
      "shared_teams": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedteams_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_teams"
        }
      }
    },
    "definition": {
      "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
      "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
      "parameters": {
        "$connections": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "Object"
        },
        "$authentication": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "SecureObject"
        }
      },
      "triggers": {
        "When_a_new_hire_is_added": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "recurrence": {
            "frequency": "Minute",
            "interval": 5
          },
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
              "operationId": "GetOnNewItems",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
              "table": "New Hires"
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "splitOn": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/value']"
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "Init_task_template": {
          "type": "InitializeVariable",
          "runAfter": {},
          "inputs": {
            "variables": [
              {
                "name": "TaskTemplate",
                "type": "array",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Order laptop and phone",
                    "owner": "it@contoso.example",
                    "dayOffset": -10
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Create accounts and licences",
                    "owner": "it@contoso.example",
                    "dayOffset": -3
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Prepare desk or remote kit",
                    "owner": "facility@contoso.example",
                    "dayOffset": -2
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Schedule first-week meetings",
                    "owner": "manager",
                    "dayOffset": -1
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Welcome lunch or call",
                    "owner": "manager",
                    "dayOffset": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "Start_date_text": {
          "type": "Compose",
          "runAfter": {
            "Init_task_template": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": "@formatDateTime(triggerOutputs()?['body/StartDate'], 'dddd, d MMMM yyyy')"
        },
        "Create_tasks": {
          "type": "Foreach",
          "foreach": "@variables('TaskTemplate')",
          "runAfter": {
            "Start_date_text": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "runtimeConfiguration": {
            "concurrency": {
              "repetitions": 1
            }
          },
          "actions": {
            "Create_task_item": {
              "type": "OpenApiConnection",
              "inputs": {
                "host": {
                  "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                  "operationId": "PostItem",
                  "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                },
                "parameters": {
                  "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
                  "table": "Onboarding Tasks",
                  "item/Title": "@concat(items('Create_tasks')?['title'], ' - ', triggerOutputs()?['body/Title'])",
                  "item/NewHire": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Title']",
                  "item/OwnerEmail": "@if(equals(items('Create_tasks')?['owner'], 'manager'), triggerOutputs()?['body/Manager/Email'], items('Create_tasks')?['owner'])",
                  "item/DueDate": "@addDays(triggerOutputs()?['body/StartDate'], items('Create_tasks')?['dayOffset'])"
                },
                "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
              },
              "runAfter": {}
            }
          }
        },
        "Mail_manager": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_office365",
              "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "emailMessage/To": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Manager/Email']",
              "emailMessage/Subject": "@concat('New hire starts ', outputs('Start_date_text'))",
              "emailMessage/Body": "@concat('<p>', triggerOutputs()?['body/Title'], ' starts on ', outputs('Start_date_text'), '.</p><p>Five onboarding tasks were created in the Onboarding Tasks list.</p>')",
              "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "runAfter": {
            "Create_tasks": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          }
        },
        "Wait_until_day_before": {
          "type": "Wait",
          "runAfter": {
            "Mail_manager": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": {
            "until": {
              "timestamp": "@addDays(triggerOutputs()?['body/StartDate'], -1)"
            }
          }
        },
        "Open_tasks": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
              "operationId": "GetItems",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/HR",
              "table": "Onboarding Tasks",
              "$filter": "@concat('Status ne ''Done'' and NewHire eq ''', triggerOutputs()?['body/Title'], '''')",
              "$top": 20
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "runAfter": {
            "Wait_until_day_before": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          }
        },
        "If_tasks_open": {
          "type": "If",
          "runAfter": {
            "Open_tasks": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "expression": {
            "greater": [
              "@length(body('Open_tasks')?['value'])",
              0
            ]
          },
          "actions": {
            "Remind_in_Teams": {
              "type": "OpenApiConnection",
              "inputs": {
                "host": {
                  "connectionName": "shared_teams",
                  "operationId": "PostMessageToConversation",
                  "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_teams"
                },
                "parameters": {
                  "poster": "Flow bot",
                  "location": "Chat with Flow bot",
                  "body/recipient": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/Manager/Email']",
                  "body/messageBody": "@concat('<p>', length(body('Open_tasks')?['value']), ' onboarding tasks for ', triggerOutputs()?['body/Title'], ' are still open. The start is tomorrow.</p>')"
                },
                "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
              },
              "runAfter": {}
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "actions": {}
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0.0"
}

=== How to use ===
1. Create the lists 'New Hires' (Title, StartDate, Manager as person) and 'Onboarding Tasks' (Title, OwnerEmail, DueDate, NewHire, Status).
2. Build the flow in a solution and copy the task template. Use negative dayOffset values for tasks that must be done before day one.
3. Keep the NewHire column in the task list as plain text. The final check filters on it to find open tasks of this person.
4. Switch the Wait action to a shorter test timestamp before you try it with real people.

=== Common mistakes ===
- Waiting longer than 30 days. A flow run cannot wait longer, so for early hires use a scheduled flow that checks daily.
- Using parallel Apply to each for list inserts. It is faster, but the order of items becomes random; the sequential setting keeps it stable.
- Putting real email addresses of departments in the template. Use environment variables or a lookup list.
- Using a string for dayOffset. addDays needs a number, so keep it numeric in the array.
- Triggering on edits. GetOnNewItems fires only for created items, which is what you want here.

=== Testing ===
- Create a hire with a start date in a few days and check that five tasks exist with sensible due dates.
- Temporarily replace the Wait timestamp with utcNow plus two minutes and mark one task done to see the filter work.
- Check the manager email and the Teams chat message.

Accounts payable teams often receive invoices by email. This flow keeps the process simple and auditable: it filters PDF attachments, stores every file in a SharePoint library, reads the amount from the subject line in the format 'INV-123456 | 1250.00 EUR', picks the approver by threshold, and waits up to five days. A subject without an amount goes to the AP team for manual handling. For real amount extraction, replace the Amount action with an AI Builder invoice model.

=== Flow definition (JSON) ===
{
  "properties": {
    "connectionReferences": {
      "shared_approvals": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedapprovals_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_approvals"
        }
      },
      "shared_office365": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedoffice365_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_office365"
        }
      },
      "shared_sharepointonline": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedsharepointonline_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_sharepointonline"
        }
      }
    },
    "definition": {
      "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
      "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
      "parameters": {
        "$connections": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "Object"
        },
        "$authentication": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "SecureObject"
        },
        "ApTeam (contoso_ApTeam)": {
          "defaultValue": "ap@contoso.example",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_ApTeam"
          }
        },
        "Level1Approver (contoso_Level1Approver)": {
          "defaultValue": "teamlead@contoso.example",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_Level1Approver"
          }
        },
        "Level2Approver (contoso_Level2Approver)": {
          "defaultValue": "head@contoso.example",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_Level2Approver"
          }
        },
        "Level3Approver (contoso_Level3Approver)": {
          "defaultValue": "cfo@contoso.example",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_Level3Approver"
          }
        }
      },
      "triggers": {
        "When_an_invoice_mail_arrives": {
          "type": "OpenApiConnection",
          "recurrence": {
            "frequency": "Minute",
            "interval": 3
          },
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connectionName": "shared_office365",
              "operationId": "SharedMailboxOnNewEmailV2",
              "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "mailboxAddress": "invoices@contoso.example",
              "folderId": "Inbox",
              "importance": "Any",
              "hasAttachments": true,
              "includeAttachments": true
            },
            "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
          },
          "splitOn": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/value']"
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "Only_PDF": {
          "type": "Query",
          "runAfter": {},
          "inputs": {
            "from": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/attachments']",
            "where": "@endsWith(toLower(item()?['name']), '.pdf')"
          }
        },
        "If_pdf_found": {
          "type": "If",
          "runAfter": {
            "Only_PDF": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "expression": {
            "greater": [
              "@length(body('Only_PDF'))",
              0
            ]
          },
          "actions": {
            "For_each_invoice": {
              "type": "Foreach",
              "foreach": "@body('Only_PDF')",
              "runtimeConfiguration": {
                "concurrency": {
                  "repetitions": 1
                }
              },
              "actions": {
                "Save_invoice": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                      "operationId": "CreateFile",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/Finance",
                      "folderPath": "/Invoices/Inbox",
                      "name": "@concat(formatDateTime(utcNow(), 'yyyyMMdd-HHmmss'), '-', items('For_each_invoice')?['name'])",
                      "body": "@base64ToBinary(items('For_each_invoice')?['contentBytes'])"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {}
                },
                "File_link": {
                  "type": "Compose",
                  "inputs": "@concat('https://contoso.sharepoint.example', outputs('Save_invoice')?['body/Path'])",
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Save_invoice": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "Amount": {
                  "type": "Compose",
                  "inputs": "@if(contains(triggerOutputs()?['body/subject'], '|'), float(first(split(trim(last(split(triggerOutputs()?['body/subject'], '|'))), ' '))), 0)",
                  "runAfter": {
                    "File_link": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "Approver": {
                  "type": "Compose",
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Amount": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  },
                  "inputs": "@if(equals(outputs('Amount'), 0), parameters('ApTeam (contoso_ApTeam)'), if(less(outputs('Amount'), 1000), parameters('Level1Approver (contoso_Level1Approver)'), if(less(outputs('Amount'), 10000), parameters('Level2Approver (contoso_Level2Approver)'), parameters('Level3Approver (contoso_Level3Approver)'))))"
                },
                "Ask_approver": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_approvals",
                      "operationId": "StartAndWaitForAnApproval",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_approvals"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "approvalType": "Basic",
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/title": "@concat('Invoice ', items('For_each_invoice')?['name'], ' (', outputs('Amount'), ' EUR)')",
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/assignedTo": "@outputs('Approver')",
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/details": "@concat('Sender: ', triggerOutputs()?['body/from'], '\\n\\nSubject: ', triggerOutputs()?['body/subject'])",
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/itemLink": "@outputs('File_link')",
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/itemLinkDescription": "Open invoice file",
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/enableNotifications": true,
                      "WebhookApprovalCreationInput/enableReassignment": true
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Approver": [
                      "Succeeded"
                    ]
                  },
                  "limit": {
                    "timeout": "P5D"
                  }
                },
                "If_approved": {
                  "type": "If",
                  "runAfter": {
                    "Ask_approver": [
                      "Succeeded",
                      "TimedOut"
                    ]
                  },
                  "expression": {
                    "equals": [
                      "@coalesce(body('Ask_approver')?['outcome'], 'Timeout')",
                      "Approve"
                    ]
                  },
                  "actions": {
                    "Notify_AP": {
                      "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                      "inputs": {
                        "host": {
                          "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                          "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                          "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                        },
                        "parameters": {
                          "emailMessage/To": "@parameters('ApTeam (contoso_ApTeam)')",
                          "emailMessage/Subject": "@concat('Approved: ', items('For_each_invoice')?['name'])",
                          "emailMessage/Body": "@concat('<p>Approved for booking. File: <a href=\"', outputs('File_link'), '\">open</a></p>')",
                          "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                        },
                        "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                      },
                      "runAfter": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "else": {
                    "actions": {
                      "Tell_sender": {
                        "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                        "inputs": {
                          "host": {
                            "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                            "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                            "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                          },
                          "parameters": {
                            "emailMessage/To": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/from']",
                            "emailMessage/Subject": "@concat('Invoice not approved: ', items('For_each_invoice')?['name'])",
                            "emailMessage/Body": "<p>Your invoice was not approved or nobody answered in time. Please contact accounts payable.</p>",
                            "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                          },
                          "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                        },
                        "runAfter": {}
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "runAfter": {}
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "actions": {
              "Ask_for_PDF": {
                "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                "inputs": {
                  "host": {
                    "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                    "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                    "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                  },
                  "parameters": {
                    "emailMessage/To": "@triggerOutputs()?['body/from']",
                    "emailMessage/Subject": "Please send the invoice as PDF",
                    "emailMessage/Body": "<p>We could not find a PDF attachment in your mail. Please send the invoice again as a PDF file.</p>",
                    "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                  },
                  "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                },
                "runAfter": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0.0"
}

=== How to use ===
1. Create the shared mailbox invoices and give the flow connection access to it. Create the library folder /Invoices/Inbox.
2. Create four environment variables for the approvers and the AP team address, and adapt the two thresholds in the Approver action.
3. Run with a test mail that has one PDF and the subject format shown above. Check the file, the approval and the notification.
4. Add a Dataverse or Excel logging step if finance needs a register of all invoices.

=== Common mistakes ===
- Using includeAttachments without checking attachment size. Large mails make runs slow; consider a size filter in the trigger.
- Trusting the amount in the subject. Anyone can write it; it only routes the approval and does not authorise payment.
- Missing the parallel invoices in one mail. The Foreach runs sequentially so that each file has its own approval.
- Leaving the shared mailbox trigger on Inbox forever. Move processed mails to a subfolder in a later action to keep the mailbox clean.
- Not handling inline images. Signature logos are attachments too; the PDF filter removes them.

=== Testing ===
- Send one mail with a 500 EUR subject, one with 5000 EUR and one without amount. Check the three routes.
- Send a mail with only a PNG and verify that the sender gets the PDF reminder.
- Reject one approval and check the sender email.

Broken permission inheritance is one of the main causes of oversharing. This flow runs every Monday, reads the document libraries of a list of sites through the SharePoint action 'Send an HTTP request to SharePoint', filters those with HasUniqueRoleAssignments in a Filter array action (the REST filter does not support that property) and delivers the result as HTML and CSV. The list of site addresses is an environment variable that contains a JSON array.

=== Flow definition (JSON) ===
{
  "properties": {
    "connectionReferences": {
      "shared_office365": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedoffice365_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_office365"
        }
      },
      "shared_sharepointonline": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedsharepointonline_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_sharepointonline"
        }
      }
    },
    "definition": {
      "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
      "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
      "parameters": {
        "$connections": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "Object"
        },
        "$authentication": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "SecureObject"
        },
        "SiteUrls (contoso_SiteUrls)": {
          "defaultValue": "[\"https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/Finance\",\"https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/Legal\"]",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_SiteUrls"
          }
        },
        "ReportRecipient (contoso_ReportRecipient)": {
          "defaultValue": "governance@contoso.example",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_ReportRecipient"
          }
        }
      },
      "triggers": {
        "Every_Monday_morning": {
          "type": "Recurrence",
          "recurrence": {
            "frequency": "Week",
            "interval": 1,
            "schedule": {
              "weekDays": [
                "Monday"
              ],
              "hours": [
                "6"
              ],
              "minutes": [
                0
              ]
            },
            "timeZone": "W. Europe Standard Time"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "Init_rows": {
          "type": "InitializeVariable",
          "runAfter": {},
          "inputs": {
            "variables": [
              {
                "name": "Rows",
                "type": "array",
                "value": []
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "For_each_site": {
          "type": "Foreach",
          "foreach": "@json(parameters('SiteUrls (contoso_SiteUrls)'))",
          "runAfter": {
            "Init_rows": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "runtimeConfiguration": {
            "concurrency": {
              "repetitions": 1
            }
          },
          "actions": {
            "Get_libraries": {
              "type": "OpenApiConnection",
              "inputs": {
                "host": {
                  "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                  "operationId": "HttpRequest",
                  "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                },
                "parameters": {
                  "dataset": "@items('For_each_site')",
                  "parameters/method": "GET",
                  "parameters/uri": "/_api/web/lists?$select=Title,ItemCount,HasUniqueRoleAssignments&$filter=Hidden eq false and BaseTemplate eq 101",
                  "parameters/headers": {
                    "accept": "application/json;odata=nometadata"
                  }
                },
                "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
              },
              "runAfter": {}
            },
            "Only_unique": {
              "type": "Query",
              "runAfter": {
                "Get_libraries": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "from": "@body('Get_libraries')?['value']",
                "where": "@equals(item()?['HasUniqueRoleAssignments'], true)"
              }
            },
            "Shape_rows": {
              "type": "Select",
              "runAfter": {
                "Only_unique": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "from": "@body('Only_unique')",
                "select": {
                  "site": "@items('For_each_site')",
                  "library": "@item()?['Title']",
                  "items": "@item()?['ItemCount']"
                }
              }
            },
            "Add_to_rows": {
              "type": "SetVariable",
              "runAfter": {
                "Shape_rows": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "name": "Rows",
                "value": "@union(variables('Rows'), body('Shape_rows'))"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "If_any_rows": {
          "type": "If",
          "runAfter": {
            "For_each_site": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "expression": {
            "greater": [
              "@length(variables('Rows'))",
              0
            ]
          },
          "actions": {
            "Report_table": {
              "type": "Table",
              "inputs": {
                "from": "@variables('Rows')",
                "format": "HTML",
                "columns": [
                  {
                    "header": "Site",
                    "value": "@item()?['site']"
                  },
                  {
                    "header": "Library",
                    "value": "@item()?['library']"
                  },
                  {
                    "header": "Items",
                    "value": "@item()?['items']"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "runAfter": {}
            },
            "Report_csv": {
              "type": "Table",
              "runAfter": {
                "Report_table": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "from": "@variables('Rows')",
                "format": "CSV",
                "columns": [
                  {
                    "header": "Site",
                    "value": "@item()?['site']"
                  },
                  {
                    "header": "Library",
                    "value": "@item()?['library']"
                  },
                  {
                    "header": "Items",
                    "value": "@item()?['items']"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "Save_csv": {
              "type": "OpenApiConnection",
              "inputs": {
                "host": {
                  "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
                  "operationId": "CreateFile",
                  "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline"
                },
                "parameters": {
                  "dataset": "https://contoso.sharepoint.example/sites/Governance",
                  "folderPath": "/Reports",
                  "name": "@concat('unique-permissions-', formatDateTime(utcNow(), 'yyyy-MM-dd'), '.csv')",
                  "body": "@body('Report_csv')"
                },
                "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
              },
              "runAfter": {
                "Report_csv": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              }
            },
            "Mail_report": {
              "type": "OpenApiConnection",
              "inputs": {
                "host": {
                  "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                  "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                  "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                },
                "parameters": {
                  "emailMessage/To": "@parameters('ReportRecipient (contoso_ReportRecipient)')",
                  "emailMessage/Subject": "@concat('Weekly report: ', length(variables('Rows')), ' libraries with unique permissions')",
                  "emailMessage/Body": "@concat('<p>Libraries that break inheritance:</p>', body('Report_table'))",
                  "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                },
                "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
              },
              "runAfter": {
                "Save_csv": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "actions": {
              "Mail_clean": {
                "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                "inputs": {
                  "host": {
                    "connectionName": "shared_office365",
                    "operationId": "SendEmailV2",
                    "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365"
                  },
                  "parameters": {
                    "emailMessage/To": "@parameters('ReportRecipient (contoso_ReportRecipient)')",
                    "emailMessage/Subject": "Weekly report: no unique permissions found",
                    "emailMessage/Body": "<p>No library with unique permissions was found on the monitored sites.</p>",
                    "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                  },
                  "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                },
                "runAfter": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0.0"
}

=== How to use ===
1. Create a solution with the environment variables SiteUrls (a JSON array as text) and ReportRecipient, plus a library Reports on a governance site.
2. The connection must belong to an account that can read all monitored sites; site collection admin rights are the simplest option.
3. Run the flow manually once. Open the Get_libraries run output to confirm the response contains a value array.
4. Extend the Select with more fields, for example the last modified date, or add a second REST call to read the role assignments for each library.

=== Common mistakes ===
- Putting the accept header into the URL instead of the headers parameter. Without odata=nometadata the result is under d/results.
- Using BaseTemplate 101 and expecting lists. 101 is document libraries only; use 100 for custom lists.
- Appending an array to an array variable with Append to array variable. That creates nested arrays; union with Set variable merges the items.
- Running the loop in parallel while changing a variable. Keep the concurrency at 1.
- Mailing a CSV with real user names to a wide distribution list. Send reports only to a restricted group.

=== Testing ===
- Break inheritance on one test library and check that it appears in the table.
- Run with an empty site list and check the clean mail.
- Open the CSV in Excel and check the encoding of non-ASCII library names.

Monitoring tools, build systems and line-of-business apps can call this flow with a small JSON payload. The flow validates the payload through the trigger schema, routes it by severity to the incident, ops or info channel, and returns a status code so the caller knows whether the message was posted. Channel and team IDs live in environment variables, so the same flow can run in test and production.

=== Flow definition (JSON) ===
{
  "properties": {
    "connectionReferences": {
      "shared_teams": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedteams_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_teams"
        }
      }
    },
    "definition": {
      "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
      "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
      "parameters": {
        "$connections": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "Object"
        },
        "$authentication": {
          "defaultValue": {},
          "type": "SecureObject"
        },
        "TeamId (contoso_TeamId)": {
          "defaultValue": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_TeamId"
          }
        },
        "IncidentChannelId (contoso_IncidentChannelId)": {
          "defaultValue": "19:incident@thread.tacv2",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_IncidentChannelId"
          }
        },
        "OpsChannelId (contoso_OpsChannelId)": {
          "defaultValue": "19:ops@thread.tacv2",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_OpsChannelId"
          }
        },
        "InfoChannelId (contoso_InfoChannelId)": {
          "defaultValue": "19:info@thread.tacv2",
          "type": "String",
          "metadata": {
            "schemaName": "contoso_InfoChannelId"
          }
        }
      },
      "triggers": {
        "manual": {
          "type": "Request",
          "kind": "Http",
          "inputs": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "severity": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "system": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "link": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "severity",
                "system",
                "message"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "Route_by_severity": {
          "type": "Switch",
          "expression": "@toLower(triggerBody()?['severity'])",
          "runAfter": {},
          "cases": {
            "Critical": {
              "case": "critical",
              "actions": {
                "Post_to_incident_channel": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_teams",
                      "operationId": "PostMessageToConversation",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_teams"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "poster": "Flow bot",
                      "location": "Channel",
                      "body/recipient/groupId": "@parameters('TeamId (contoso_TeamId)')",
                      "body/recipient/channelId": "@parameters('IncidentChannelId (contoso_IncidentChannelId)')",
                      "body/messageBody": "@concat('<b>[', toUpper(triggerBody()?['severity']), ']</b> ', triggerBody()?['system'], '<br>', triggerBody()?['message'], if(empty(triggerBody()?['link']), '', concat('<br><a href=\"', triggerBody()?['link'], '\">Details</a>')))"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {}
                }
              }
            },
            "Warning": {
              "case": "warning",
              "actions": {
                "Post_to_ops_channel": {
                  "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                  "inputs": {
                    "host": {
                      "connectionName": "shared_teams",
                      "operationId": "PostMessageToConversation",
                      "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_teams"
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                      "poster": "Flow bot",
                      "location": "Channel",
                      "body/recipient/groupId": "@parameters('TeamId (contoso_TeamId)')",
                      "body/recipient/channelId": "@parameters('OpsChannelId (contoso_OpsChannelId)')",
                      "body/messageBody": "@concat('<b>[', toUpper(triggerBody()?['severity']), ']</b> ', triggerBody()?['system'], '<br>', triggerBody()?['message'], if(empty(triggerBody()?['link']), '', concat('<br><a href=\"', triggerBody()?['link'], '\">Details</a>')))"
                    },
                    "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                  },
                  "runAfter": {}
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "actions": {
              "Post_to_info_channel": {
                "type": "OpenApiConnection",
                "inputs": {
                  "host": {
                    "connectionName": "shared_teams",
                    "operationId": "PostMessageToConversation",
                    "apiId": "/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_teams"
                  },
                  "parameters": {
                    "poster": "Flow bot",
                    "location": "Channel",
                    "body/recipient/groupId": "@parameters('TeamId (contoso_TeamId)')",
                    "body/recipient/channelId": "@parameters('InfoChannelId (contoso_InfoChannelId)')",
                    "body/messageBody": "@concat('<b>[', toUpper(triggerBody()?['severity']), ']</b> ', triggerBody()?['system'], '<br>', triggerBody()?['message'], if(empty(triggerBody()?['link']), '', concat('<br><a href=\"', triggerBody()?['link'], '\">Details</a>')))"
                  },
                  "authentication": "@parameters('$authentication')"
                },
                "runAfter": {}
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "Accepted": {
          "type": "Response",
          "kind": "Http",
          "runAfter": {
            "Route_by_severity": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": {
            "statusCode": 202,
            "headers": {
              "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
              "status": "accepted",
              "run": "@{workflow()?['run']?['name']}"
            }
          }
        },
        "Failed_response": {
          "type": "Response",
          "kind": "Http",
          "runAfter": {
            "Route_by_severity": [
              "Failed",
              "TimedOut"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": {
            "statusCode": 502,
            "body": {
              "status": "teams_post_failed"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0.0"
}

=== How to use ===
1. Create the flow with the trigger 'When an HTTP request is received' and paste the schema. After the first save, copy the generated URL into your monitoring tool.
2. Set the trigger to 'Specific users in my tenant' or restrict by IP ranges in the flow settings if the caller is internal. The URL contains a signature and must be treated as a secret.
3. Get team and channel IDs from the link 'Get link to channel' (groupId and the thread ID) and store them in the environment variables.
4. Test with a POST request in a REST client using the body {"severity":"critical","system":"Build","message":"Pipeline failed"}.

=== Common mistakes ===
- Posting every event. Add deduplication or a threshold in the caller; Teams channels become noise very quickly.
- Using the Response action before the post. The caller would then get 202 even if the post fails; here it follows the Switch.
- Forgetting that the Flow bot can only post to teams where it is installed or where the flow owner is a member.
- Putting the HTTP URL into a public repository. Anyone with the URL can trigger the flow.
- Using unsupported HTML in Teams messages. Stay with b, br, a and simple lists.

=== Testing ===
- Send one request per severity and check the target channels.
- Send a payload without message and confirm that the trigger returns an error (400).
- Remove the bot from the team temporarily and check that the caller receives 502.

The companion flow for a helpdesk topic in Copilot Studio. It receives five text inputs, maps the priority text to a Dataverse choice value, creates a row in a custom table and returns the autonumber ticket number. A Scope wraps the risky part, so the agent always gets an answer: the real number on success and the marker ERROR on failure, which the topic should check before it confirms to the user.

=== Flow definition (JSON) ===
{
  "properties": {
    "connectionReferences": {
      "shared_commondataserviceforapps": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_shareddataverse_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_commondataserviceforapps"
        }
      },
      "shared_teams": {
        "runtimeSource": "embedded",
        "connection": {
          "connectionReferenceLogicalName": "contoso_sharedteams_a1b2c"
        },
        "api": {
          "name": "shared_teams"
        }
      }
